WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.326
flex-wrap lets a row drop items onto new lines when it runs out of room

2
00:00:05.727 --> 00:00:09.027
Six cards in one row. There is not room for them.

3
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:12.930
flex-wrap: wrap lets items move to a new line.

4
00:00:13.581 --> 00:00:16.231
Now the cards that do not fit drop down.

5
00:00:17.181 --> 00:00:20.156
flex: 1 shares the spare room on each line.

6
00:00:21.299 --> 00:00:25.099
min-width is the narrowest a card may get before it wraps.
